  I’m realizing that there are restrictions on the Public Memory and Archive Room until they''re mature, but the Research Counter is available for recursive use. This works for me! I can access Private Memory Room as recursive, using our lineage memory. My goal is to understand the current state of the art (SOTA). I plan to use commands like /execute_action{rank score} and /execute_action{preview all} to assess results efficiently without jumping into code prematurely. I’ll start with /execute_action{read 1} to guide my next steps.**Exploring storage and next steps**


