    \ Internal γ, Adam lr=9e-4, Clip=1.0\n**ID:** 450\n**Tags:** fourier, layernorm, learnable-gamma, scalar-ramp, replication\n**Abstract:** Replicate internal learnable horizon γ (learn_gamma=True) on the Fourier LN forecaster. Config: p=36, H=160, drop=0.05, Adam lr=9e−4, clip=1.0. Loss: MAE+curvature (λ=1e−4).\n**Score:** -0.026124798079228934\n**Val_MAE_1:** 0.0197\n**Val_MAE_4:** 0.0229\n**Val_MAE_8:** 0.0254\n**Val_MAE_16:** 0.0270\n**Val_MAE_32:** 0.0278\n**Evaluation Details:** Mean over 3 seeds | Step MAEs computed on validation set\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys, optax\nsys.path.append('storage/ariadne')\n\nfrom models_fourier_ramp import create_network, export_stats\nfrom losses import mae_with_temporal_curvature\n\nBASE_SEED = 42\nBATCH_SIZE = 8\n\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    return {\n        'learning_rate': 9e-4,\n        'rank_k': 320,\n        'proj_rank': 36,\n        'hidden_size': 160,\n        'drop': 0.05,\n        'gamma_start': 0.25,\n   \
    \     'gamma_end': 0.99,\n        'learn_gamma': True\n    }\n\ndef compute_loss(predictions, targets, params, x):\n    return mae_with_temporal_curvature(predictions, targets, params, x, lam=1e-4)\n\ndef create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n    return optax.chain(\n        optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0),\n        optax.adam(learning_rate=learning_rate)\n    )\n\ndef complete(params, opt_state, trial_data):\n    export_stats(params, trial_data, _define_hyperparameters(), out_dir=\"storage/ariadne/analyses/fourier_learn_gamma_internal\")\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 32, 71721)\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nTesting compute_loss...\n✓ Compute loss works - loss value: 0.000000\nTesting training\
