    \ Adam lr=9e−4, clip=1.0, drop=0.05, p=36.\n**Score:** -0.02625345848400133\n**Val_MAE_1:** 0.0194\n**Val_MAE_4:** 0.0229\n**Val_MAE_8:** 0.0255\n**Val_MAE_16:** 0.0272\n**Val_MAE_32:** 0.0281\n**Evaluation Details:** Mean over 3 seeds | Step MAEs computed on validation set\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport os, json, sys\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\nimport optax\n\nsys.path.append('storage/ariadne')\nfrom models_fourier_ramp import create_network as create_base_network\n\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    return {\n        'learning_rate': 9e-4,\n        'rank_k': 320,\n        'proj_rank': 36,      # p\n        'hidden_size': 160,   # H (confirmation on stronger fixed-ramp baseline)\n        'drop': 0.05,\n        'gamma_start': 0.25,\n        'gamma_end': 0.99,\n        'learn_gamma': False,  # fixed scalar ramp baseline\n        'delta': 0.01          # Huber threshold\n    }\n\ndef create_network(hparams):\n    return create_base_network(hparams)\n\ndef _huber(abs_r, delta):\n\
    \    quad = (abs_r <= delta)\n    return jnp.where(quad, 0.5 * (abs_r ** 2) / delta, abs_r - 0.5 * delta)\n\ndef compute_loss(predictions, targets, params, x):\n    delta = _define_hyperparameters().get('delta', 0.01)\n    abs_err = jnp.abs(predictions - targets)             # (B,32,N)\n    hub = _huber(abs_err, delta)\n    data_term = jnp.mean(hub)\n\n    # Temporal curvature penalty (second-difference L1 across time)\n    d2 = predictions[:, 2:, :] - 2.0 * predictions[:, 1:-1, :] + predictions[:, :-2, :]\n    curvature = jnp.mean(jnp.abs(d2))\n\n    return data_term + 1e-4 * curvature\n\ndef create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 9e-4):\n    return optax.chain(\n        optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0),\n        optax.adam(learning_rate=learning_rate)\n    )\n\ndef complete(params, opt_state, trial_data):\n    try:\n        os.makedirs(\"storage/ariadne/analyses/huber_sweep\", exist_ok=True)\n        out = {\n            \"trial_number\": trial_data.get(\"trial_number\"),\n        \
    \    \"seed\": trial_data.get(\"seed\"),\n            \"val_mae\": trial_data.get(\"val_mae\"),\n            \"hyperparameters\": trial_data.get(\"hyperparameters\"),\n            \"note\": \"ScalarRamp H=160 with Huber(delta=0.01) + curvature (confirmation)\"\n        }\n        with open(\"storage/ariadne/analyses/huber_sweep/confirm_H160_delta_0.01.json\", \"w\") as f:\n            json.dump(out, f, indent=2)\n    except Exception:\n        pass\n\nBASE_SEED = 42\nBATCH_SIZE = 8\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 32, 71721)\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nTesting compute_loss...\n✓ Compute loss works - loss value: 0.000000\nTesting training step...\n✓ Training step works\nTesting complete function...\n\
