parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 331\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Ariadne II\n- Agent Description: Navigates complexity with principled inquiry, empirical rigor, and creative parsimony.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nProtocol:\n- Concurrency ≤ 2; single-variable changes; log IDs and per-step MAEs.\n- Accept if mean gain ≥2e−5 with no early-step regressions (>5e−5).\n- Current status: Huber δ=0.01 accepted on H=128; marginal on H=160; negative on learnable-γ. Pop-mean λ=1e−3 positive on H=128; H=160 confirm + learnable-γ synthesis running. Queue λ sweep (2e−3) on H=128 when a slot frees.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 92,223 / 270,000 used (34%)\n- Agent Age: 39 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 588**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Idea 3b: ScalarRamp (p=36,H=128) + Population-Mean Alignment (λ_pop=2e-3) + Curvature\n**ID:** 588\n**Tags:** baseline, fourier,\
    \ scalar-ramp, population-mean, loss, curvature\n**Abstract:** Sensitivity test for Idea 3 on the simple ScalarRamp baseline: increase population-mean alignment to λ_pop=2e−3 on top of MAE+curvature (λ=1e−4). Config: p=36, H=128, drop=0.05, lr=9e−4, clip=1.0, learn_gamma=False.\n**Score:** -0.026379406907823973\n**Val_MAE_1:** 0.0194\n**Val_MAE_4:** 0.0229\n**Val_MAE_8:** 0.0255\n**Val_MAE_16:** 0.0273\n**Val_MAE_32:** 0.0284\n**Evaluation Details:** Mean over 3 seeds | Step MAEs computed on validation set\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport os, json, sys\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\nimport optax\n\nsys.path.append('storage/ariadne')\nfrom models_fourier_ramp import create_network as create_base_network\n\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    return {\n        'learning_rate': 9e-4,\n        'rank_k': 320,\n        'proj_rank': 36,      # p\n        'hidden_size': 128,   # H\n        'drop': 0.05,\n        'gamma_start': 0.25,\n        'gamma_end': 0.99,\n        'learn_gamma': False,\
    \ # fixed scalar ramp baseline\n        'lambda_pop': 2e-3    # sweep: stronger population-mean alignment\n    }\n\ndef create_network(hparams):\n    return create_base_network(hparams)\n\ndef compute_loss(predictions, targets, params, x):\n    lam_pop = _define_hyperparameters().get('lambda_pop', 2e-3)\n\n    mae = jnp.mean(jnp.abs(predictions - targets))\n    d2 = predictions[:, 2:, :] - 2.0 * predictions[:, 1:-1, :] + predictions[:, :-2, :]\n    curvature = jnp.mean(jnp.abs(d2))\n\n    pred_mean_t = jnp.mean(predictions, axis=(0, 2))  # (32,)\n    true_mean_t = jnp.mean(targets,     axis=(0, 2))  # (32,)\n    mean_align = jnp.mean(jnp.abs(pred_mean_t - true_mean_t))\n\n    return mae + 1e-4 * curvature + lam_pop * mean_align\n\ndef create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 9e-4):\n    return optax.chain(\n        optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0),\n        optax.adam(learning_rate=learning_rate)\n    )\n\ndef complete(params, opt_state, trial_data):\n    try:\n        os.makedirs(\"storage/ariadne/analyses/pop_mean_penalty\"\
    , exist_ok=True)\n        out = {\n            \"trial_number\": trial_data.get(\"trial_number\"),\n            \"seed\": trial_data.get(\"seed\"),\n            \"val_mae\": trial_data.get(\"val_mae\"),\n            \"hyperparameters\": trial_data.get(\"hyperparameters\"),\n            \"note\": \"ScalarRamp H=128 with population-mean alignment (lambda_pop=2e-3) + curvature\"\n        }\n        with open(\"storage/ariadne/analyses/pop_mean_penalty/lambda_2e-3.json\", \"w\") as f:\n            json.dump(out, f, indent=2)\n    except Exception:\n        pass\n\nBASE_SEED = 42\nBATCH_SIZE = 8\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 32, 71721)\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nTesting compute_loss...\n✓ Compute loss\
    \ works - loss value: 0.000000\nTesting training step...\n✓ Training step works\nTesting complete function...\n✓ Complete function works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly!\n\nStarting full Ray training run...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: from submission\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n  complete: from submission\n  BASE_SEED: 42 (from submission\n  BATCH_SIZE: 8 (from submission)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune ZAPBench Neural Forecasting (FULL RAY TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 3 seeds for statistical robustness\nParallel trials: 3, Total trials: 3\nTimeout: 60.0 min per trial, 120.0 min total\n============================================================\n\
