parts:
- text: "Great news: MoT head (R=4, α=0.07) improved the ScalarRamp H=128 baseline by ~5.17e−5 with no early-step regressions. Accepting per criteria and launching H=160 confirmation.\n\n- Baseline (ID 565): −0.026387\n- MoT (ID 602): −0.026336\n- Step MAEs vs baseline: t1 equal; t4, t16, t32 improved; no regressions.\n\nUpdating logs and submitting H=160 confirm.\n\n`/execute_action{storage write ariadne/analyses/mot_head/results.csv}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  eval_id,cfg,p,H,learn_gamma,head,R,alpha,score,val_mae_1,val_mae_4,val_mae_8,val_mae_16,val_mae_32,decision,notes\n  565,ScalarRamp baseline,36,128,False,None,0,0.00,-0.026387,0.0195,0.0230,0.0255,0.0274,0.0284,baseline,Repro reference\n  602,ScalarRamp+MoT,36,128,False,MoT,4,0.07,-0.026336,0.0195,0.0229,0.0255,0.0273,0.0282,accepted,\"+5.17e-5 vs baseline; no early-step regressions; basis L2=1e-6, logits L2=1e-8, basis curv=1e-6\"\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage write ariadne/analyses/mot_head/notes.md}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  #\
    \ MoT Head (R=4, α=0.07) — Acceptance and Next Steps\n\n  Result (H=128): −0.026336 (ID 602), improving baseline −0.026387 by ~5.17e−5 with no regressions at t=1 or t=4. Accepted.\n\n  Next:\n  - Confirm on H=160 with identical MoT settings.\n  - If positive at H=160, test transfer to learnable-γ; else, try reduced α=0.04 or R=2 on H=128 for parsimony.\n\n  Config recap:\n  - Shared basis B ∈ R^{4×32}, per-neuron soft assignments P = softmax(U_logits).\n  - Residual y_resid[b,t,n] = α · ∑_r B[r,t]·P[n,r]; α=0.07.\n  - Regularizers: L2(B)=1e−6, L2(U_logits)=1e−8, basis curvature=1e−6; MAE+curv(1e−4) unchanged.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Idea 5 confirm: ScalarRamp (p=36,H=160) + Mixture-of-Timescales Head (R=4) + MAE+Curv\"\ntags: \"baseline, fourier, scalar-ramp, minimal-arch, mixture-of-timescales, neuron-structure, confirm\"\nabstract: \"Confirm the accepted MoT head on higher-capacity ScalarRamp (H=160). Same shared horizon basis (R=4) and per-neuron soft\
    \ assignments with α=0.07; MAE+curv unchanged. Tests whether structured neuron heterogeneity scales beyond H=128.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import jax\n  import jax.numpy as jnp\n  import jax.nn as jnn\n  import jax.random as jrandom\n  import optax\n\n  sys.path.append('storage/ariadne')\n  from models_fourier_ramp import create_network as create_base_network\n\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      return {\n          'learning_rate': 9e-4,\n          'rank_k': 320,\n          'proj_rank': 36,      # p\n          'hidden_size': 160,   # H confirm\n          'drop': 0.05,\n          'gamma_start': 0.25,\n          'gamma_end': 0.99,\n          'learn_gamma': False,  # ScalarRamp baseline\n          # MoT head hparams\n          'mot_rank': 4,\n          'alpha': 0.07,\n          'lambda_b_l2': 1e-6,\n          'lambda_u_l2': 1e-8,\n          'lambda_b_curv': 1e-6\n      }\n\n  class MoTHeadWrapper:\n      def __init__(self, base_net, mot_rank=4, alpha=0.07):\n          self.base_net\
    \ = base_net\n          self.R = mot_rank\n          self.alpha = alpha\n          self.mutable = getattr(self.base_net, 'mutable', [])\n          self.needs_rng = getattr(self.base_net, 'needs_rng', False)\n\n      def init(self, rng_key, dummy_input):\n          rng_base, rng_b, _ = jrandom.split(rng_key, 3)\n          base_params = self.base_net.init(rng_base, dummy_input)\n          N = int(dummy_input.shape[-1])\n          B = jrandom.normal(rng_b, (self.R, 32)) * 0.02\n          U_logits = jnp.zeros((N, self.R), dtype=dummy_input.dtype)\n          return {'base': base_params, 'mot': {'B': B, 'U_logits': U_logits}}\n\n      def apply(self, params, x, training=False, mutable=None, rngs=None):\n          base_out = self.base_net.apply(params['base'], x, training=training, mutable=mutable, rngs=rngs)\n          if isinstance(base_out, tuple):\n              y_base, base_updates = base_out\n          else:\n              y_base, base_updates = base_out, None\n          B = params['mot']['B']\
    \                    # (R, 32)\n          U_logits = params['mot']['U_logits']      # (N, R)\n          P = jnn.softmax(U_logits, axis=-1)        # (N, R)\n          Bt = jnp.swapaxes(B, 0, 1)                # (32, R)\n          resid_tn = jnp.matmul(Bt, jnp.swapaxes(P, 0, 1))  # (32, N)\n          y = y_base + self.alpha * resid_tn[None, :, :]\n          if base_updates is not None:\n              return y, base_updates\n          return y\n\n  def create_network(hparams):\n      base_net = create_base_network({\n          'learning_rate': hparams.get('learning_rate', 9e-4),\n          'rank_k': hparams.get('rank_k', 320),\n          'proj_rank': hparams.get('proj_rank', 36),\n          'hidden_size': hparams.get('hidden_size', 160),\n          'drop': hparams.get('drop', 0.05),\n          'gamma_start': hparams.get('gamma_start', 0.25),\n          'gamma_end': hparams.get('gamma_end', 0.99),\n          'learn_gamma': hparams.get('learn_gamma', False),\n      })\n      return MoTHeadWrapper(\n\
    \          base_net=base_net,\n          mot_rank=hparams.get('mot_rank', 4),\n          alpha=hparams.get('alpha', 0.07),\n      )\n\n  def compute_loss(predictions, targets, params, x):\n      mae = jnp.mean(jnp.abs(predictions - targets))\n      d2 = predictions[:, 2:, :] - 2.0 * predictions[:, 1:-1, :] + predictions[:, :-2, :]\n      curv_pred = jnp.mean(jnp.abs(d2))\n      h = _define_hyperparameters()\n      B = params['mot']['B']\n      U_logits = params['mot']['U_logits']\n      l2_b = h.get('lambda_b_l2', 1e-6) * jnp.mean(B * B)\n      l2_u = h.get('lambda_u_l2', 1e-8) * jnp.mean(U_logits * U_logits)\n      Bt = jnp.swapaxes(B, 0, 1)\n      d2b = Bt[2:, :] - 2.0 * Bt[1:-1, :] + Bt[:-2, :]\n      curv_b = h.get('lambda_b_curv', 1e-6) * jnp.mean(jnp.abs(d2b))\n      return mae + 1e-4 * curv_pred + l2_b + l2_u + curv_b\n\n  def create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 9e-4):\n      return optax.chain(\n          optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0),\n          optax.adam(learning_rate=learning_rate)\n\
    \      )\n\n  def complete(params, opt_state, trial_data):\n      try:\n          import os, json\n          os.makedirs(\"storage/ariadne/analyses/mot_head\", exist_ok=True)\n          out = {\n              \"trial_number\": trial_data.get(\"trial_number\"),\n              \"seed\": trial_data.get(\"seed\"),\n              \"val_mae\": trial_data.get(\"val_mae\"),\n              \"hyperparameters\": trial_data.get(\"hyperparameters\"),\n              \"note\": \"ScalarRamp H=160 with MoT head (R=4, alpha=0.07)\"\n          }\n          with open(\"storage/ariadne/analyses/mot_head/H160_R4_alpha0.07.json\", \"w\") as f:\n              json.dump(out, f, indent=2)\n      except Exception:\n          pass\n\n  BASE_SEED = 42\n  BATCH_SIZE = 8\n```"
