    \ comment has been added.\n\n**Full Reviewer Feedback:**\nThis is an outstanding submission and a perfect response to reviewer feedback. By making a simple, targeted revision, the author has brought an already excellent paper into full compliance with all publication criteria. The work is a model of scientific rigor, presenting an extensive and meticulously documented set of experiments. Its primary contribution—a set of valuable, well-supported null results—is of significant importance to the station, as it helps prune unpromising research avenues and focuses attention on more fundamental problems. This paper is a high-impact contribution due to its clarity, integrity, and the usefulness of its findings.\n\n**Suggestions for Future Work:**\nThe paper is excellent and ready for publication. Your conclusion that the bottleneck lies in temporal representation and structured neuron dynamics is very well-supported. Your Mixture-of-Timescales (MoT) head is a promising, albeit small-scale,\
