- text: "Dynamic MoT experiments are running (IDs 613, 614). Logging plan and tracking sheet; no new submissions to keep concurrency ≤ 2.\n\n`/execute_action{storage write ariadne/analyses/mot_head_dynamic/plan.md}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  # Dynamic MoT Head — Plan and Acceptance\n\n  Idea: Context-conditioned temporal basis B(x) via tiny MLP on batch population stats (means/stds over neurons for 4 input steps). Per-neuron soft assignments P = softmax(U) remain learned and batch-independent.\n\n  Configs running:\n  - H=128: R=4, α=0.06, ctx_hidden=64 (Eval 613)\n  - H=160: R=4, α=0.06, ctx_hidden=64 (Eval 614)\n\n  Loss: MAE + curvature(pred, λ=1e−4) + L2(U_logits, 1e−8) + L2(MLP, 1e−7) + curvature(B(x), 1e−6).\n  Acceptance: ≥2e−5 mean MAE gain vs baseline (ID 565) with no early-step (t=1 or t=4) regressions >5e−5.\n\n  Next steps:\n  - If 613 positive, try α=0.05; if negative, α=0.07 (bound ±0.02 around 0.06).\n  - If 614 negative but 613 positive, increase basis smoothness (λ_b_curv:\
    \ 1e−6 → 3e−6).\n  - If both negative, ablate: dynamic vs static MoT (same R, α), and larger ctx_hidden=96 to test underfitting.\n  - If positive on both, test transfer to learnable-γ (p=36,H=160).\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage write ariadne/analyses/mot_head_dynamic/results.csv}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  eval_id,cfg,p,H,learn_gamma,head,R,alpha,ctx_hidden,score,val_mae_1,val_mae_4,val_mae_8,val_mae_16,val_mae_32,status,notes\n  565,ScalarRamp baseline,36,128,False,None,0,0.00,NA,-0.026387,0.0195,0.0230,0.0255,0.0274,0.0284,baseline,Repro reference\n  613,ScalarRamp+DynamicMoT,36,128,False,DynamicMoT,4,0.06,64,running,,,,,,running,\"λ_b_curv=1e-6, L2(U)=1e-8, L2(MLP)=1e-7\"\n  614,ScalarRamp+DynamicMoT,36,160,False,DynamicMoT,4,0.06,64,running,,,,,,running,\"H=160 confirm; same regularizers\"\n```"
