- text: "Recording GRU head results and tracking the running ablation; no new experiments to keep concurrency ≤ 2.\n\n`/execute_action{storage write ariadne/analyses/shared_state_head/results.csv}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  eval_id,cfg,p,H,learn_gamma,head,R,gru_h,alpha,lambda_b_curv,score,val_mae_1,val_mae_4,val_mae_8,val_mae_16,val_mae_32,status,notes\n  565,ScalarRamp baseline,36,128,False,None,0,0,0.00,NA,-0.026387,0.0195,0.0230,0.0255,0.0274,0.0284,baseline,Repro reference\n  625,ScalarRamp+SharedStateGRU,36,128,False,GRU,4,32,0.06,1e-6,-0.026395,0.0194,0.0229,0.0255,0.0274,0.0283,done,\"Base GRU head negative vs baseline\"\n  626,ScalarRamp+SharedStateGRU,36,128,False,GRU,4,32,0.07,1e-6,running,,,,,,running,\"α sweep (match MoT scale)\"\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage write ariadne/analyses/shared_state_head/notes.md}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Shared Temporal State (GRU) Head — interim\n\n  Debugger fixes (Eval 625):\n  - GRUCell requires features=h_dim.\n  - Params tree must contain\
    \ only tensors; moved ctx_dim out of params.\n\n  Results:\n  - H=128 GRU head (R=4, h=32, α=0.06): −0.026395 (worse than baseline −0.026387).\n  - α=0.07 ablation (ID 626) running.\n\n  Interpretation:\n  - With α=0.06 the shared-state residual is underpowered; α=0.07 may recover some capacity (as with Dynamic MoT).\n  - If α=0.07 remains negative, next ablations: α=0.05 (conservative), R=2 (parsimonious), or ↑ smoothness λ_b_curv×3 to reduce horizon jitter.\n\n  Acceptance criterion:\n  - ≥2e−5 mean MAE gain vs baseline with no early-step regressions (>5e−5 at t=1/4).\n```"
